      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIK this is still implicitly switching on a bunch of other drivers, like clk etc. Those should have been modularized upstream. Can you confirm that this ARCH symbol will not pull in vexpress-specific drivers to the GKI core? Yes, we know about HISI/QCOM, but that tech debt is for test targets we can\u0027t do without - otherwise we are pushing back on ARCH_* that build drivers into GKI.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "31e91cabeab426a15ed178e9486e88605a0a2601",
