      "writtenOn": "2020-10-15T19:25:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, these drivers have been modularized now thanks to Rob Herring\u0027s work. Setting ARCH_VEXPRESS here was still implicitly setting the drivers to \u003dy but since there are no more direct dependencies on the variable any more we can just stop setting it here and enable the drivers with \u003dm in the FVP config.\n\nThe flag for the CLK driver is still behind this:\n\nmenu \"Clock driver for ARM Reference designs\"\n  depends on ARCH_INTEGRATOR || ARCH_REALVIEW || \\\n          ARCH_VERSATILE || ARCH_VEXPRESS || COMPILE_TEST\n\nWhich means that the driver will not be built if ARCH_VEXPRESS is disabled. But since it turns out that the CLK driver is not required in order to boot we can just not build it for now until the issue is resolved upstream. I locally removed the depends clause and added CONFIG_CLK_VEXPRESS_OSC\u003dm to FVP config and it seems to result in a working module. I will propose that we remove depends upstream as well.",
      "parentUuid": "b594b135_382946ed",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "31e91cabeab426a15ed178e9486e88605a0a2601",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
